% \begin{abstract}
%
%    The \pkg{titlesec} package is incomatible with the new tagging
%    code and if it is used together with \cs{DocumentMetadata} (with
%    or without tagging turned on) it will generate a number of
%    warnings followed by package errors---in other words the
%    combination is not usable.
%
%    The following code implements an emulation of \pkg{titlesec}
%    usable with the tagging support code. For now only some of the
%    package interfaces are supported and all others will bail out
%    with a suitable error message.

%    If \cs{DocumentMetadata} is used and \pkg{titlesec} is
%    requested then the emulation is loaded instead.
%    As long as the emulation is still being worked on the emulation
%    is also available under the name \pkg{latex-lab-titlesec}.
% \end{abstract}
%
%
